{"metadata":{"description":"Session categories plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1339327246","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-session-categories","slug":"ht719/dsh-session-categories","topics":["category","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Session categories plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-categories"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Session Categories adds user-managed category trees to the dsh sidebar. Each Workspace keeps its own"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" categories, and each session can belong to at most one category."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The package includes the Host entry, Web client bundle, and Cordis profile patch. No separate Client"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" or Bundle package is required."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it looks like"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The sidebar groups sessions inside clear, collapsible category containers. The screenshot shows the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"Workspace, category, and session hierarchy in the current plugin layout."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Within a Workspace, you can:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- create a session directly inside a category;
- expand or collapse categories without losing their "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"hierarchy;
- drag a session into another category;
- create a top-level category from the Workspace "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"actions menu;
- create a child category, or rename and delete the current category, from the categor"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"y actions menu;
- move a session with the folder icon on the **Move to category** action."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Expanded categories use nested containers with a fixed inset at each depth. Sessions receive one add"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"itional inset beyond their category, and drag targets highlight without changing row dimensions. Col"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"lapsed Workspace rows show a hierarchy icon when they contain categories or sessions."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install from GitHub"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The `dsh` command must be available in your shell. Install the prebuilt package directly into an unm"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"odified dsh Web profile:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If you are running dsh from a source checkout, use its package launcher instead:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The repository includes generated runtime files, so a separate plugin build is not required."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For the unreleased GitHub version, install directly from the repository:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Behavior and data"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Deleting a category recursively archives its sessions; it never deletes their durable logs. Archive "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"operations are retried with the same operation id and recover after a restart. Mutations reject stal"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"e revisions, cross-Workspace session ids, descendant moves, and assignments to unknown categories."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin targets the current dsh prerelease plugin APIs and is intended to work with an unmodified"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" dsh installation. dsh does not promise pre-release compatibility across versions, so update dsh and"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" this plugin together when upgrading."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Source layout"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The repository root is the installable prebuilt package. Source packages are retained under `package"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"s/workspace/session-categories/`, `packages/client/ui-session-categories/`, and `packages/bundle/ses"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"n-categories/`, `packages/client/ui-session-categories/`, and `packages/bundle/session-categories/`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The plugin is composed as an ordinary Cordis row. It does not require changes to `ui-workspace`, `ui"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"-slots`, `api-remotes`, or other core dsh packages."}],"truncated":false}
